                <p data-w-id="71d20794-cf3e-bd2a-c793-73aaefc22a01" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="section-summary white">At PixelReach, we build impactful digital presence for brands by combining keyword‑rich SEO, paid ads, social engagement, content marketing, branding and conversion‑focused design. Our data‑driven approach covers search engine optimization, PPC, social media strategy, email automation</p>
              </div>
              <div data-w-id="77ebac21-6d92-898e-e7a3-f6d14c05a62d" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="what-we-do-content-block">
                <div class="what-we-do-card-block">
                  <div class="what-we-do-number-block">
                    <h3 class="what-we-do-number">01</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="what-we-do-text-block">
                    <h4 class="what-we-do-title">SEO &amp; Organic Growth</h4>
                    <p class="what-we-do-summary">Drive long-term traffic and visibility with our SEO and organic growth strategies. From on-page optimization to content planning, we help your brand rank higher and attract the right audience naturally.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="what-we-do-card-block">
                  <div class="what-we-do-number-block">
                    <h3 class="what-we-do-number">02</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="what-we-do-text-block">
                    <h4 class="what-we-do-title">Social Media</h4>
                    <p class="what-we-do-summary">Engage your audience and grow your brand with our expert social media management. We create, schedule, and optimize content across platforms to boost visibility, build trust, and drive real engagement.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="what-we-do-card-block">
                  <div class="what-we-do-number-block">
                    <h3 class="what-we-do-number">03</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="what-we-do-text-block">
                    <h4 class="what-we-do-title">Branding</h4>
                    <p class="what-we-do-summary">Elevate your brand with impactful visuals and strategic design. From logos to full brand identities, we craft creative assets that capture attention, communicate your values, and leave a lasting impression.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="what-we-do-card-block">
                  <div class="what-we-do-number-block">
                    <h3 class="what-we-do-number">04</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="what-we-do-text-block">
                    <h4 class="what-we-do-title">Email Marketing</h4>
                    <p class="what-we-do-summary">Drive engagement and boost conversions with targeted email campaigns. We create personalized, visually appealing emails that speak to your audience and deliver measurable results for your business grow</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="team-section">
